# MyManaBox settings.
# Copy this file to .env (cp .env.example .env) and put your own values there.
# .env is listed in .gitignore, so it never gets committed. This example file has no secrets.
#
# Scryfall needs no API key. If the app used an API that did, the key would go in .env like this:
# SOME_API_KEY=your-secret-key

# The name the app gives Scryfall in the User-Agent header. Scryfall asks for contact info here.
SCRYFALL_USER_AGENT=MyManaBox/1.0 (github.com/your-github-name)
